{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3707400/extras/36c7966b51fafdad64159206441a4e99.poster.avif?t=1763405319\" width=800 height=259 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3707400/extras/36c7966b51fafdad64159206441a4e99.webm?t=1763405319\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><i>On-Together</i> is a\u00a0cozy <strong>virtual co-working game</strong> that sits at the bottom of your screen while you focus on your tasks and socialize at break-time! <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3707400/extras/d419566009e4839c8fe20273c82ae8b1.avif?t=1763405319\" width=616 height=76 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3707400/extras/f498c24a47224ae71e1977e572777417.poster.avif?t=1763405319\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3707400/extras/f498c24a47224ae71e1977e572777417.webm?t=1763405319\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3707400/extras/f498c24a47224ae71e1977e572777417.mp4?t=1763405319\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stay connected while you study in a shared co-working chatroom space. Join conversations effortlessly, just like in a real study lounge\u2014whether you're working solo or with friends. Perfect for study streams or quiet collaboration.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3707400/extras/712d6a38097755cc8cbd5f99d38ba0cf.avif?t=1763405319\" width=616 height=70 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your personal built-in focus timer, to-do list, calendar, and journal to track tasks, set goals, and reflect on progress, keeping you focused and motivated. Stay focused long enough and a super cute customizable pet buddy will join you :)<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3707400/extras/dc25e6857ad04d288b5ba71ac77923e7.poster.avif?t=1763405319\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3707400/extras/dc25e6857ad04d288b5ba71ac77923e7.webm?t=1763405319\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3707400/extras/dc25e6857ad04d288b5ba71ac77923e7.mp4?t=1763405319\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3707400/extras/76731cffc72a2a9fe75334e051046d67.avif?t=1763405319\" width=616 height=64 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>On-Together</i> lets you hang out, play multiplayer games, personalize your avatar, and more! Enjoy fun activities at your own pace, adding freedom to your workflow.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3707400/extras/9a935f8f41590ab53834dd43dfc50af0.poster.avif?t=1763405319\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3707400/extras/9a935f8f41590ab53834dd43dfc50af0.webm?t=1763405319\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3707400/extras/9a935f8f41590ab53834dd43dfc50af0.mp4?t=1763405319\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3707400/extras/c4a90743dda3f47f71612fea5fdcdc81.avif?t=1763405319\" width=616 height=69 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Progress over time by staying on task, discovering new features, or engaging with the community. Unlock new customization options along the way!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you\u2019re working, studying, or just fartin\u2019 around, On-Together will help keep you company throughout the day.<br>  <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3707400/extras/024176bf5c606f4dfbe1ad9e709f0cc3.poster.avif?t=1763405319\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3707400/extras/024176bf5c606f4dfbe1ad9e709f0cc3.webm?t=1763405319\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3707400/extras/024176bf5c606f4dfbe1ad9e709f0cc3.mp4?t=1763405319\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pet companions will join you when you're super busy!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3707400/extras/94cdabc23cc55bb878ea1bfe491c8ca4.poster.avif?t=1763405319\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3707400/extras/94cdabc23cc55bb878ea1bfe491c8ca4.webm?t=1763405319\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3707400/extras/94cdabc23cc55bb878ea1bfe491c8ca4.mp4?t=1763405319\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u2026 Oh, and did we mention we have multiple screen display options? </strong>    <br>     <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3707400/extras/b7839827f0d6f7ed22febf8a4abc63d5.poster.avif?t=1763405319\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3707400/extras/b7839827f0d6f7ed22febf8a4abc63d5.webm?t=1763405319\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3707400/extras/b7839827f0d6f7ed22febf8a4abc63d5.mp4?t=1763405319\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your cozy study companions, always on your screen\u2014whether fullscreen or neatly at the<br> bottom or top. Designed to make productivity feel both social and personal!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >    Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Work together! </strong>Join your friends in the digital lounge for some cozy co-working.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Share together! </strong>Play in fullscreen or keep the screen neatly to the side!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Track together! </strong>Keep on track with timers, calendars, checklists and more.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Play together! </strong>Take regular breaks and do fun activities with your friends.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>On Together! </strong>Discover new features, customize your avatar, and stay engaged.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store